# The project-level Streamlit config IS part of the repo. The `.streamlit/`
# rule near the top of this file comes from a Windows user-profile template
# and would otherwise exclude it. Git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so the directory must be negated first.
!.streamlit/
!.streamlit/config.toml
